   Workers Launched: 1
   ->  Parallel Custom Scan (DocumentDBApiExplainQueryScan) (actual rows=7000 loops=2)
         namespaceName: parallel_entry_restart_db.items
         indexName: a_1
         indexKey: {"a": 1}
         isMultiKey: false
         indexBounds: ["a": [MinKey, 9000]], ["a": (Infinity, MaxKey]]
         innerScanLoops: 7000-14100 loops
         parallelScanLoops: 7000-14100 loops
         parallelScanCapable: true
         scanType: ordered
         scanKeyDetails: key 1: [(isInequality: true, estimatedEntryCount: xxx), (isInequality: true, estimatedEntryCount: xxx)]
         ->  Parallel Index Scan using a_1 on documents_2401 collection (actual rows=xyz loops=2)
               Index Cond: (document OPERATOR(documentdb_api_internal.@!>) '{ "a" : { "$numberInt" : "9000" } }'::bson)
(16 rows)

